{"id":"g2ply370cxdvghy00co296arj","title":"Commodore PET – 世界上第一台个人电脑","originalTitle":"Commodore PET – The Worlds First Personal Computer","summary":"Commodore PET 在1977年1月的消费电子展上首次亮相，比Apple II和Radio Shack TRS80还要早几个月，成为世界上第一台个人电脑。这款电脑配备了1 MHz的MOS 6502处理器、4K内存、键盘、集成显示器和操作系统，一经推出便大受欢迎，但初期生产量有限，仅在第一年生产了500台。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://www.commodore.ca/commodore-products/commodore-pet-the-worlds-first-personal-computer/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T23:15:34.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-08T00:55:25.430Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T00:55:25.430Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","GitHub"],"score":24,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"c9b18006-11dd-43e9-ac2d-24a2d2c4c70c","title":"Commodore PET被确认为1977年CES首台个人电脑"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"c9b18006-11dd-43e9-ac2d-24a2d2c4c70c","title":"Commodore PET被确认为1977年CES首台个人电脑"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f-JSODZ_yCzw","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}